+"""Large natural-language benchmark generator (scheme E).
+
+Scheme E composition:
+- **A** (template slots + sentence variants): 80-90% of task/resume records are
+  rendered from deterministic templates with slot variation, sentence patterns
+  and synonym-style connector choices. Every ``task_text`` and ``resume_text``
+  is natural language, never a bare field concatenation.
+- **B** (latent DGP): workers carry latent reliability/skill/preferences, tasks
+  carry latent difficulty/urgency, customers carry latent strictness. Those
+  latents drive accept/reject, on-time and rating outcomes, and the hidden gold
+  label per task.
+- **C** (LLM seeds): an optional ``llm_seeds`` dict hook, off by default, that
+  injects caller-supplied natural-language seeds into a small deterministic
+  subset of records (subject to the same dedup guarantees). No LLM is required.
+
+The module deliberately stores no ground truth on model-visible records: task
+rows carry no gold/category columns, and ``load_large_sqlite`` (in
+``app.benchmark.large``) never returns labels.
